
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.GetPhysicsMaterial(): {any}`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`list llGetPhysicsMaterial();`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Used to get the physical characteristics of an object.</p>
  <p>Returns a list in the form `[ [float](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Float) **gravity_multiplier**, [float](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Float) **restitution**, [float](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Float) **friction**, [float](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Float) **density** ]`</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>physics</li>
        <li>prim</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">381</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-mandatory">Use Return</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>The default values for <b>friction</b> and <b>restitution</b> depend upon the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_MATERIAL" target="_blank">material type</a>.</p>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A collision between two objects with <b>restitution</b> 1.0 will still not be perfectly elastic due to damping in the physics engine.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat

function LLEvents.touch_start(events)
    local total_number = #events
    local params = ll.GetPhysicsMaterial()
    ll.OwnerSay("\nGravity multiplier: " .. tostring(ll.List2Float(params, 0)) .. "\nRestitution: " .. tostring(ll.List2Float(params, 1)) .. "\nFriction: " .. tostring(ll.List2Float(params, 2)) .. "\nDensity: " .. tostring(ll.List2Float(params, 3)) .. "kg/m^3")
end
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
    touch_start(integer total_number)
    {
        list params = llGetPhysicsMaterial();
        llOwnerSay(
            "\nGravity multiplier: " + (string)llList2Float(params, 0) +
            "\nRestitution: " + (string)llList2Float(params, 1) +
            "\nFriction: " + (string)llList2Float(params, 2) +
            "\nDensity: " + (string)llList2Float(params, 3) + "kg/m^3"
        );
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
